{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsnavigationlistitem"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSNavigationListItem","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Navigations"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSNavigationListItem"},{"type":"text","text":" is an interactive variant of the list item that triggers an action when tapped."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It displays a navigation indicator (chevron for next\/previous, or an external link icon)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to communicate the type of navigation to the user."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The item typically contains a label, and optionally a description, an overline, an extra label,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a text slot, a bottom slot, and a helper text — all provided through "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can also include an optional leading element (such as an icon, image, avatar, flag or custom view)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and an optional trailing element (such as a text, badge, tag, icon, image, avatar, flag or custom view)"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For non-interactive,